        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 100000\n    annual_coupon_rate = 0.05\n    annual_market_rate = 0.04\n    years_to_maturity = 10\n    payments_per_year = 2\n\n    coupon_payment = (face_value * annual_coupon_rate) / payments_per_year\n    period_rate = annual_market_rate / payments_per_year\n    total_payments = years_to_maturity * payments_per_year\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    pv_coupons = sum(\n        coupon_payment / ((1 + period_rate) ** period)\n        for period in range(1, total_payments + 1)\n    )\n    pv_face_value = face_value / ((1 + period_rate) ** total_payments)\n    answer = round(pv_coupons + pv_face_value)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
